repository-code: 'https://github.com/LuisMRaimundo/Textural-Cardinality'
url: 'https://github.com/LuisMRaimundo/Textural-Cardinality'
version: 1.0.0
keywords:
  - vertical cardinality
  - symbolic music analysis
  - textural cardinality
  - computational musicology
license: Proprietary
abstract: >-
  Cardinality-only symbolic toolkit with GUI and exports for vertical note count,
  unique pitch count, and pitch-class cardinality over time in notated scores.
  Uses exact event-boundary temporal sampling so brief vertical states are not
  missed between grid points.
